\/132006","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132006.png","packs":[{"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","position":6,"quantity":3,"image_code":"132006","illustrator":"Jeff Lee Johnson","octgnid":"6778eb01-6b07-4dbe-87f1-e854ab548813","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132006.png","date_release":"2013-02-22"},{"pack_code":"DoD","pack_name":"Dwarves of Durin","position":11,"quantity":3,"image_code":"31011","illustrator":"Jeff Lee Johnson","octgnid":"8a319f9f-4d96-4e8f-90eb-ee6a4bc59f39","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/31011.png","date_release":"2022-11-04"}]},{"type_code":"ally","type_name":"Ally","sphere_code":"lore","sphere_name":"Lore","position":7,"code":"132007","name":"Bifur","traits":"Dwarf.","text":"While you control at least 5 <b><i>Dwarf<\/i><\/b> characters, Bifur gains: \"<b>Response:<\/b> After you play Bifur from your hand, draw 2 cards.\"","flavor":"\"My cousins! Bombur and Bofur <cite> we have forgotten them, they are down in the valley!\" \u2013The Hobbit<\/cite>","is_unique":true,"cost":"3","willpower":1,"attack":2,"defense":1,"health":3,"deck_limit":3,"has_errata":false,"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","illustrator":"Taylor Ingvarsson","octgnid":"c4b959f5-92a9-4f46-8656-f9da08a5cb86","quantity":3,"url":"https:\/\/ringsdb.com\/card\/132007","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132007.png","packs":[{"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","position":7,"quantity":3,"image_code":"132007","illustrator":"Taylor Ingvarsson","octgnid":"c4b959f5-92a9-4f46-8656-f9da08a5cb86","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132007.png","date_release":"2013-02-22"}]},{"type_code":"ally","type_name":"Ally","sphere_code":"spirit","sphere_name":"Spirit","position":8,"code":"132008","name":"Dwalin","traits":"Dwarf.","text":"Sentinel.\r\nWhile you control at least 5 <b><i>Dwarf<\/i><\/b> characters, lower the cost to play Dwalin by 2.","flavor":"As soon as the door was opened, he pushed inside, just as if he had been expected. \u2013The Hobbit","is_unique":true,"cost":"