 Mountain, and his companions followed him. <cite>The Hobbit<\/cite>","is_unique":false,"cost":"1","deck_limit":3,"has_errata":false,"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","illustrator":"Tiziano Baracchi","octgnid":"16ae4f56-d8bb-41b8-a992-1da3b6ec1fdb","quantity":3,"url":"https:\/\/ringsdb.com\/card\/132012","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132012.png","packs":[{"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","position":12,"quantity":3,"image_code":"132012","illustrator":"Tiziano Baracchi","octgnid":"16ae4f56-d8bb-41b8-a992-1da3b6ec1fdb","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132012.png","date_release":"2013-02-22"}]},{"type_code":"event","type_name":"Event","sphere_code":"baggins","sphere_name":"Baggins","position":13,"code":"132013","name":"The Lucky Number","text":"<b>Action:<\/b> Choose a character in play (other than Bilbo Baggins). Add Bilbo Baggins' total [willpower], [attack], and [defense] to that character's [willpower], [attack], and [defense] respectively until the end of the phase.","flavor":"\"I am the clue-finder, the web-cutter, the stinging fly. I was chosen for the lucky number.\"\r\n<cite>Bilbo Baggins, The Hobbit<\/cite>","is_unique":false,"cost":"1","deck_limit":3,"has_errata":false,"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","illustrator":"Magali Villeneuve","octgnid":"65407141-e013-4d1c-8f70-4328e707d0cc","quantity":3,"url":"https:\/\/ringsdb.com\/card\/132013","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132013.png","packs":[{"pack_code":"OtD","pack_name":"On the Doorstep","position":13,"quantity":3,"image_code":"132013","illustrator":"Magali Villeneuve","octgnid":"65407141-e013-4d1c-8f70-4328e707d0cc","imagesrc":"\/bundles\/cards\/132013.png","date_release":"2013-02-22"}]},{"type_code":"attachment","type_name":"Attachment","sphere_code":"tactics","sphere_name":"Tactics","position":14,"code":"132014","name":"Great Yew Bow","traits":"Item. Weapon.","text":"Attach to a hero with the printed Ranged keyword. Restricted.\r\n<b>Combat Action:<\/b> Choose an ene